From 6ccd97580534cfa29c2e5f9ef4b8899d83f2151a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anant <aanantduhan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:00:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(stacked): render stacked toasts correctly in all
 positions

- Order stacked toasts by depth so the newest stays on top and at the edge
- Overlap using each toast's measured height instead of a fixed 44px
- Fix bottom positions applying the overlap to the wrong edge
- Pause every toast in the stack while it is hovered or focused
- Add --tc-peek CSS variable and stacked-mode regression tests
- Fix a test that leaked a toaster into later tests
